{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/GameDesc_Story.gif?t=1750039720\" /></div>You embark on a journey to purify supernatural beings through duels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/GameDesc_Monster.gif?t=1750039720\" /></div>Featuring supernatural yet beautiful boss monsters and cute pixel monsters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/change.png?t=1750039720\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/GameDesc_Battle.gif?t=1750039720\" /></div>I.P.U is a 2D side-scrolling action game where you fight against supernatural beings that swarm you and bosses that appear at regular intervals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you successfully defeat a boss or increase your level, you can obtain randomly appearing pixel art equipment and enjoy various types of battles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/img_sc_battle_1.png?t=1750039720\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/img_sc_battle_2.png?t=1750039720\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2950350?t=1750039720","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/295